3807 :knowledge-point/questions "question-789ea0d3-54ac-52af-9aa3-c806bd076e69"] ["question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232" :question/id #uuid "d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232"] ["question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232" :question/math-academy-id "q-139653"] ["question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232" :question/problem "| $x$ | **$-3$** | **$-1$** | **$1$** | **$3$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $-5$ | $-25$ | $5$ | $20$ | $35$ |\n\nThe vector of coefficients of the curve $y={\\beta }_{0}+{\\beta }_{1}x+{\\beta }_{2}{x}^{2}$ that best fits the data above can be found using polynomial regression as \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{0} \\\\ {\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2}\\end{aligned}]=({X}^{T}\\,X)^{-1}{X}^{T}y,\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the corresponding design matrix and $y$ is the observation vector. Which of the following is the observation vector $y$ in this context?"] ["question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232" :question/worked-solution "| $x$ | **$-3$** | **$-1$** | **$1$** | **$3$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $-5$ | $-25$ | $5$ | $20$ | $35$ |\n\nThe coefficients of the curve \n\n$$\ny={\\beta }_{0}+{\\beta }_{1}x+{\\beta }_{2}{x}^{2}\n$$\n\nthat best fits the data can be found as the least-squares solution $\\overset{^}{\\beta }$ to the system \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{X}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & (-3)^{2} \\\\ 1 & -1 & (-1)^{2} \\\\ 1 & 1 & {1}^{2} \\\\ 1 & 3 & {3}^{2} \\\\ 1 & 5 & {5}^{2}\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{\\beta }{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{0} \\\\ {\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2}\\end{aligned}]}} & =\\overset{y}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -25 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 20 \\\\ 35\\end{aligned}]}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the design matrix, $\\beta $ is the parameter vector, and $y$ is the observation vector."] ["question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1"] ["answer-a348d2b4-ce93-5a99-a6ed-1906d407475a" :answer/id #uuid "a348d2b4-ce93-5a99-a6ed-1906d407475a"] ["answer-a348d2b4-ce93-5a99-a6ed-1906d407475a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a348d2b4-ce93-5a99-a6ed-1906d407475a" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}(-3)^{2} \\\\ (-1)^{2} \\\\ {1}^{2} \\\\ {3}^{2} \\\\ {5}^{2}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-65dd863d-70c0-5170-aa9a-00b0ab5e1a31" :answer/id #uuid "65dd863d-70c0-5170-aa9a-00b0ab5e1a31"] ["answer-65dd863d-70c0-5170-aa9a-00b0ab5e1a31" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-65dd863d-70c0-5170-aa9a-00b0ab5e1a31" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}(-5)^{2} \\\\ (-25)^{2} \\\\ {5}^{2} \\\\ {20}^{2} \\\\ {35}^{2}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-625975e6-7869-5a67-bc59-519fa2d8371d" :answer/id #uuid "625975e6-7869-5a67-bc59-519fa2d8371d"] ["answer-625975e6-7869-5a67-bc59-519fa2d8371d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-625975e6-7869-5a67-bc59-519fa2d8371d" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-a61433c9-2b22-57c8-9478-14e323e7d6b6" :answer/id #uuid "a61433c9-2b22-57c8-9478-14e323e7d6b6"] ["answer-a61433c9-2b22-57c8-9478-14e323e7d6b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a61433c9-2b22-57c8-9478-14e323e7d6b6" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -25 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 20 \\\\ 35\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-a6559ef5-d440-5051-9b33-5e541b8f53b5" :answer/id #uuid "a6559ef5-d440-5051-9b33-5e541b8f53b5"] ["answer-a6559ef5-d440-5051-9b33-5e541b8f53b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a6559ef5-d440-5051-9b33-5e541b8f53b5" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/correct "answer-a61433c9-2b22-57c8-9478-14e323e7d6b6"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/choices "answer-a348d2b4-ce93-5a99-a6ed-1906d407475a"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/choices "answer-65dd863d-70c0-5170-aa9a-00b0ab5e1a31"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/choices "answer-625975e6-7869-5a67-bc59-519fa2d8371d"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/choices "answer-a61433c9-2b22-57c8-9478-14e323e7d6b6"] ["answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1" :answer-field/choices "answer-a6559ef5-d440-5051-9b33-5e541b8f53b5"] ["question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-b4aab56a-66ce-5d92-bf05-9bff500864c1"] [17592186133823 :knowledge-point/questions "question-d9bbc936-cdf8-5bb2-be25-3df4f1bc3232"] [17592186134389 :question/problem "| $x$ | **$1$** | **$2$** | **$3$** | **$4$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $1$ | $-1$ |\n\nThe vector of coefficients of the curve $y={\\beta }_{0}+{\\beta }_{1}x+{\\beta }_{2}{x}^{2}+{\\beta }_{3}{x}^{3}$ that best fits the data above can be found using polynomial regression as \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{0} \\\\ {\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2} \\\\ {\\beta }_{3}\\end{aligned}]=({X}^{T}\\,X)^{-1}{X}^{T}y,\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the corresponding design matrix and $y$ is the observation vector. Which of the following is the design matrix $X$ in this context?"] [17592186134389 :question/worked-solution "| $x$ | **$1$** | **$2$** | **$3$** | **$4$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $1$ | $-1$ |\n\nThe coefficients of the curve \n\n$$\ny={\\beta }_{0}+{\\beta }_{1}x+{\\beta }_{2}{x}^{2}+{\\beta }_{3}{x}^{3}\n$$\n\nthat best fits the data can be found as the least-squares solution $\\overset{^}{\\beta }$ to the system \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{X}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & {1}^{2} & {1}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 2 & {2}^{2} & {2}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 3 & {3}^{2} & {3}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 4 & {4}^{2} & {4}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 5 & {5}^{2} & {5}^{3}\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{\\beta }{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{0} \\\\ {\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2} \\\\ {\\beta }_{3}\\end{aligned}]}} & =\\overset{y}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the design matrix, $\\beta $ is the parameter vector, and $y$ is the observation vector."] [17592186134389 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-8f5c471a-3743-58fa-b032-6489b39478a8" :answer/id #uuid "8f5c471a-3743-58fa-b032-6489b39478a8"] ["answer-8f5c471a-3743-58fa-b032-6489b39478a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8f5c471a-3743-58fa-b032-6489b39478a8" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & {1}^{2} & {1}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 2 & {2}^{2} & {2}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 3 & {3}^{2} & {3}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 4 & {4}^{2} & {4}^{3} \\\\ 1 & 5 & {5}^{2} & {5}^{3}\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-aec9c374-1a4f-55d4-a0d4-1da3da5ab4af" :answer/id #uuid "aec9c374-1a4f-55d4-a0d4-1da3da5ab4af"] ["answer-aec9c374-1a4f-55d4-a0d4-1da3da5ab4af" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-aec9c374-1a4f-55d4-a0d4-1da3da5ab4af" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-2ab6240c-a811-5ed5-a876-ef55a74dd515" :answer/id #uuid "2ab6240c-a811-5ed5-a876-ef55a74dd515"] ["answer-2ab6240c-a811-5ed5-a876-ef55a74dd515" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2ab6240c-a811-5ed5-a876-ef55a74dd515" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-f6744f4c-62ff-5cd6-b5e9-04b41d3ac340" :answer/id #uuid "f6744f4c-62ff-5cd6-b5e9-04b41d3ac340"] ["answer-f6744f4c-62ff-5cd6-b5e9-04b41d3ac340" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f6744f4c-62ff-5cd6-b5e9-04b41d3ac340" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-dfd58429-3797-5